  "title": "Spicy Mexican Cream Cheese Dip",
  "description": "This Mexican-inspired cream cheese dip with corn, jalapenos, and bacon is made for a crowd--serve it with tortilla chips and crackers at your next party.",
  "authors": [
    "Jen Ciemiewicz"
  ],
